{"data": [{"author_id": "6374602", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:00:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114809371322687933"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 53, "id": "12701122", "start": 40, "username": "astrosociety"}]}, "id": "2114809371322687933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 6201, "like_count": 100, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Blue Origin's John Couluris says at the @astrosociety Von Braun Symposium today that the company is planning to activate the rebuilt LC-36A in early to mid December with a New Glenn return to flight still possible before year's end.", "url": "https://x.com/jeff_foust/status/2114809371322687933"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:51:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114807132977807552"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 125, "id": "28184452", "start": 111, "username": "NASA_Marshall"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/edok7cluHC", "end": 188, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114807132977807552/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114807121577463809", "start": 165, "url": "https://t.co/edok7cluHC"}]}, "id": "2114807132977807552", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 4990, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "The next panel focuses on Artemis 3 and beyond hosted by Steve Creech, Human Landing System program manager at @NASA_Marshall. Follow this thread for updates.\n\n🧵1/n https://t.co/edok7cluHC", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114807132977807552"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:40:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114804342637334811"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 53, "id": "12701122", "start": 40, "username": "astrosociety"}, {"end": 83, "id": "1336976892", "start": 75, "username": "LMSpace"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/EomqdTzqLc", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114804342637334811/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114804040764735489", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/EomqdTzqLc"}]}, "id": "2114804342637334811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3070, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Discussing the Artemis 2 mission at the @astrosociety von Braun Symposium, @LMSpace's Kirk Shireman says regarding data that he'd love to have from the mission would be to retrieve the European Service Module to be able to examine the pressure regulator that had a leak. He also https://t.co/EomqdTzqLc", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2114804342637334811"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:29:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114801524358406570"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 13, "id": "29472803", "start": 4, "username": "NASAWebb"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CT6zPZbA1u", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2114801524358406570/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114801519371436033", "start": 191, "url": "https://t.co/CT6zPZbA1u"}]}, "id": "2114801524358406570", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 44, "impression_count": 179348, "like_count": 951, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 61, "retweet_count": 130}, "text": "The @NASAWebb telescope recently spotted stars brewing in this cosmic cauldron. This region of toil and trouble, named N159, is 161,000 light-years from Earth, in the Large Magellanic Cloud. https://t.co/CT6zPZbA1u", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2114801524358406570"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-26T18:59:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114794151606620584"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/GiveDirectly/s…", "end": 52, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/GiveDirectly/status/2114694007334801673", "start": 29, "url": "https://t.co/ZIs0ePHdkN"}]}, "id": "2114794151606620584", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 4187, "like_count": 67